1792430366.064	AFS power test firmware - press any key within 2 s for the console
1792430366.077	commands:
1792430366.077	  show                    print configuration
1792430366.088	  set <key> <value>       keys: sleep fill settle measure drain dry gnss reg move
1792430366.088	                          ncycles cpu modem gnssen force apn host port path
1792430366.099	  cycle                   run one full cycle now, stay awake
1792430366.099	  auto                    cycle -> deep sleep(sleep) -> cycle ... (ncycles, 0=forever)
1792430366.110	  step <name>             hold one subsystem on until any key
1792430366.110	  sleep <s>               deep sleep for s seconds, then back to this console
1792430366.121	  modem on|off            power the SIM7000G up/down
1792430366.121	  at <command>            send a raw AT command
1792430366.132	  echo on|off             show AT traffic
1792430366.132	  vbat                    battery and solar voltage
1792430366.132	  read [n]                print all analog inputs n times (1 s apart)
